      "writtenOn": "2024-08-30T22:01:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know why it would need C compatible layout. I removed it and everything still works fine as far as I can tell.\n`Binder` and `DeathRecipient`(where I copied this pattern) both have `repr(C)` in this file. They were like that in the initial patchset in the CL adding them aosp/1340500. I\u0027m asking the author just in case.",
      "parentUuid": "3f592dfb_d697df74",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 718,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 718,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "0f6344943c3be2bf3055943f85d83e5fc65a8a68",
