      "writtenOn": "2024-09-03T22:46:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should only be needed if the struct is part of an ABI. I\u0027m pretty confident you don\u0027t need it and that it can be removed from `DeathRecipient`. Haven\u0027t looked closely at `Binder`",
      "parentUuid": "e58568c6_5f498a82",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 718,
        "startChar": 0,
